/**
 * Adapter that prepares sage's web editor (Monaco Editor) for the technology being learned.
 * This file is optional; when present it is loaded in the browser as an ES module.
 *
 * - setup({ monaco, project }): called once when Monaco has loaded. Register type definitions or languages here
 * - open({ monaco, editor, project, question }): called every time a question is opened. Configure the editor (IStandaloneCodeEditor) here
 *   question is { number, slug, difficulty, title, answerFileName, answerFilePath, language (Monaco language id) }
 *
 * project reads files inside the project (nothing outside it):
 * - project.readFiles(dir, suffixes): files under dir whose name ends with one of suffixes, as { relativePath: content }
 * - project.readFile(path): the content of one file (null when missing)
 *
 * Only URLs can be imported (npm package names cannot be resolved). Errors show up in the browser console.
 */

